    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Skiing is a popular winter sport. Here are some of the best ski resorts in Beijing."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Nanshan Ski Resort "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "南山滑雪场"
          }
        ],
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Location: Miyun county "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "密云县"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", a 1.5-hour drive from Tian’anmen Square"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Nanshan Ski Resort is the largest ski resort in northern China. The resort "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "is equipped with",
            "ref": "v-equipped"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " many ski "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "facilities",
            "ref": "v-facility"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "slopes",
            "zh": "斜坡"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It offers over 5,000 sets of ski equipment for renting. Nanshan has two "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "cable car",
            "zh": "缆车"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " lines. Each cable car can hold two to four people at a time. There are also special "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "snowmobile tracks",
            "zh": "摩托雪橇轨道"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for children."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Badaling Ski Resort "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "八达岭滑雪场"
          }
        ],
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Location: About five kilometres away from the Badaling Great Wall"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Badaling Ski Resort offers tourists a lot of fun winter activities, such as skiing, ice sculpture and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "snow sauna",
            "zh": "桑拿浴"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The resort has ski slopes of different difficulty levels. They can meet the needs of different skiers. Badaling Ski Resort also has a 2,300-metre-long snowmobile track. It is the longest snowmobile track in Beijing."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h3",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Beijing Yuyang Ski Resort "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "北京渔阳国际滑雪场"
          }
        ],
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Location: Pinggu district "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "平谷区"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", a 90-minute drive from the city centre"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Beijing Yuyang Ski Resort is one of the largest ski resorts around Beijing. It has eleven different ski slopes. The resort combines hiking, winter activities, dining and other forms of "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "entertainment",
            "ref": "v-entertainment"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It is open into the evening. Skiers can enjoy the night scenery of Beijing there."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
